  "question": {
    "text": "A wholesale merchant wants to start the business of cereal with \\(₹ 24000\\). Wheat is \\(₹ 400\\) per quintal and rice is \\(₹ 600\\) per quintal. He has capacity to store 200 quintal cereal. He earns the profit \\(₹ 25\\) per quintal on wheat and ₹ 40 per quintal on rice. If he store \\(\\mathrm{x}\\) quintal rice and y quintal wheat, then for maximum profit the objective function is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "PjASy",
      "text": "\\(25 x+40 y\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
